# **ST Production House — Complete AI Capability & Infrastructure Architecture**



Updated master architecture

Owner-governed autonomous system



The updated architecture combines the complete AI capability hierarchy with two essential ownership rules:

1. **Every Director is an independent creative studio and media business**, owning its universe, identity, context, memory, production decisions, teams, content catalogue and publishing accounts.
2. **HERMES is the Managing Director and delegated executive authority.** When the Owner is unavailable, HERMES can make decisions and act within explicitly delegated permissions. It never becomes the Owner and cannot override Owner-reserved decisions.

The target is not simply a collection of AI agents. It is a cloud-operated, secure, autonomous, multi-universe production organization.

